+{
+  "tool": "built-in image_gen",
+  "references": [],
+  "images": [
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/789-bobblehead.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text alone, with no reference images. Output a square 1024x1024 image. Use case: product-mockup.\nAn authentic bobblehead figurine product photograph on a car dashboard. The subject is a painted resin caricature of a woman in her early 30s, curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, and a mustard-yellow knit sweater, happily enjoying a tiny coffee cup held in her little hand. A small sculpted croissant rests nearby on the round base. The bobblehead style dictates the anatomy: a hugely oversized, broad round head, approximately two thirds of the figure height, on a tiny squat body, and a CLEARLY VISIBLE exposed metal coil spring between the head and sweater collar. Thick sculpted curls, molded sweater knit texture, glossy painted resin with shiny specular highlights; this is unmistakably a manufactured toy, not a human. Blank round base sitting on the textured car dashboard, windshield and softly blurred road beyond. Low dashboard-level three-quarter camera angle emphasizing the giant head, full figurine and circular base visible, strong natural afternoon windshield lighting. No text, captions, signatures, logos, watermarks, lettering or writing anywhere, especially none on the base."
+    },
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/790-scale-figure.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text alone, with no reference images. Output a square 1024x1024 image. Use case: product-mockup.\nAuthentic premium 1/7 scale anime PVC collectible figure product photography on a seamless white studio backdrop. A fully sculpted and painted plastic figure representing a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, delicate freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater. She is enjoying coffee, holding a little coffee cup raised toward her face in one hand and a crisply sculpted croissant in the other. The style fully dictates anatomy: sophisticated anime figure proportions, large glossy anime eyes with painted highlights, a small sculpted nose and stylized expressive face, slender limbs, graceful relaxed standing pose and a slight turn of her hips; recognizably an adult character. Entire standing figure large in the square frame, shoes and circular clear acrylic display base visible. Slightly low three-quarter catalog camera angle. Crisp individually sculpted auburn ringlets, sharp molded sweater knit, carefully painted freckles, smooth PVC surfaces, subtle part seams, lifelike product photography of an anime sculpture, absolutely not a photograph of a real woman. Controlled bright studio softbox lighting, delicate grounded shadows, tack-sharp macro-quality material detail, white backdrop. No packaging. No text, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks."
+    },
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/791-papercraft.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text alone, with no reference images. Output a square 1024x1024 image. Use case: product-mockup.\nPhotograph of a handmade cut-and-fold low-poly papercraft model assembled from printed matte cardstock, standing on a green gridded cutting mat. The large paper figure represents a woman in her early 30s with shoulder-length curly auburn hair made entirely of angular folded paper curls, freckles and round tortoiseshell glasses printed flat on the faceted paper face, mustard-yellow sweater with a FLAT PRINTED knit pattern. She is enjoying coffee, holding an angular folded paper coffee cup close to her mouth. A small faceted cardstock croissant sits near her feet. The paper medium dictates the anatomy: faceted polygon head, angular block-like torso, simplified geometric arms and legs; all flat planar surfaces and sharp creases, no organic sculpted curves. Three-quarter overhead camera view looking down at the model and visible top planes, asymmetric craft-table composition, figure fills most of the image. Clearly visible cardstock edges, folds, a few exposed glue tabs, slightly lifted glued seams, flat printed shading and textures, natural craft imperfections. Cutting mat grid has only lines with NO numbers or letters. Soft workbench lighting emphasizes planar facets and paper fibers. No text, captions, signatures, logos, watermarks, writing or labels anywhere."
+    },
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/792-needle-felt.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text alone, with no reference images. Output a square 1024x1024 image. Use case: product-mockup.\nAuthentic needle-felted wool figurine photograph in warm natural window light on a wooden table. A lovingly handmade rounded soft wool doll representing a woman in her early 30s with shoulder-length curly auburn wool hair, tiny freckle stitches, round wire glasses in mottled tortoiseshell brown, tiny dark bead eyes, and a mustard-yellow wool sweater. She is enjoying coffee, nestled in a relaxed seated pose with short little legs extended, cradling a tiny felted coffee cup near her chest in one hand and holding a tiny felted croissant in the other. The needle-felt craft dictates all anatomy and details: squat rounded body, soft lumpy handmade forms, stubby limbs, small bead eyes and a simple stitched smile, no smooth skin or hard plastic surfaces. Intimate close three-quarter side view at tabletop level, seated doll large in frame, the face turned gently toward the window light. Very visible fuzzy wool fibers, little auburn wool curls, stray fibers illuminated at the edges, needle-punched felt texture throughout. Cozy quiet wooden tabletop, soft out-of-focus room behind, gentle side lighting and shallow depth of field, warm restrained natural colors. No text, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks."
+    }
+  ]
+}

